			"notes": "📦 v1.4.3.5 - The Update\n\n✨ New Features & Content\nNew Loot Tables:\n\nSculk Fox: Added a dedicated loot table.\n\nSculk Enderman: Now drops Ender Pearls and Sculk items.\n\nSculk Creeper: Updated loot rates; now drops Gunpowder along with Sculk items.\n\nMob Spawning: Sculk Fish can now spawn in underground water sources.\n\nDecorative Plants: Certain grass and flower types now drop as collectible items when broken, allowing for decorative use.\n\n⚖️ Gameplay & Balance Changes\nStructure Generation: Increased the spawn rate of all Boss Structures by 25%.\n\nMining Mechanics: Increased the hardness and mining time for all Granulite blocks and ores.\n\nCombat Mechanics: Sculkbow now requires arrows in the inventory to function.\n\nItem Balancing: Adjusted power levels for various items for better gameplay balance.\n\n🔧 Technical Updates & Fixes\nSystem Overhaul: Completely revamped the Spawner System for better performance and logic.\n\nAnimation Fix: Fixed a glitch in the Sculk Skeleton animation.\n\nBlock Physics: Flowers and grass now correctly break when their supporting block is destroyed.\n\nRendering Fix: Fixed a transparency issue where Trapdoors appeared invisible from the side.\n\nGeneral: Various minor bug fixes and performance improvements."
